-- הסכם קיבוצי — תיקון הסכם ספטמבר 2016: הקצאת עלות, קידום בדרגות וטבלאות
-- שכר (19.3.2017): the amendment of the agreement of 30.9.2016 ("הסכם
-- ספטמבר 2016"). The 2016 agreement's period and its exhaustion of claims
-- run a year longer, to 30.6.2019; two more one-time promotions to grades
-- 7–9 ((ג1) from the day of entitlement, (ג2) from 1.4.2017) and when their
-- differences are paid; the salary-protection supplement of §5(ב) without
-- the seniority deduction, and cancelled at a promotion; the shekel
-- supplement of §6(ב) rewritten — by grade from 1.3.2017, raised from
-- 1.6.2019, 1.9.2019 and 1.9.2020 — and when it is paid; §7 (the default
-- allocation) void; §10 (budgetary pensioners) rewritten, with this
-- agreement's annex א' (the coefficient X) in place of annex ה'; the
-- guides' exception of §11(ב)(1) struck out; new role allowances from
-- 1.9.2017 (§39ב of the base agreement) and 1.9.2019 (§39ג), for teachers
-- on the reform and off it; the counselling allowance's rates raised from
-- 1.9.2019; the earlier agreements; and the September 2016 agreement's
-- exhaustion and industrial peace reaching this one.
--
-- The annex is DATA: the coefficient table is written cell for cell as the
-- corpus publishes it, and checked against what the text says of it.
--
-- An amendment encodes what it changes, dated, and imports the rest: the
-- September 2016 agreement (its rules this one replaces from their days),
-- the base agreement's §2 (language), §39 (the subject coordinator's
-- allowance and the two-allowance cap the new allowances follow) and §131
-- (the counselling allowance), and the completion agreement of 29.2.2012
-- (its §39(ב1), which the new allowances follow too). The supreme follow-up
-- committee's decision of 19.2.2015, the Ministry's letter of 25.12.2008
-- and the follow-up committee's decision of 15.9.2013 are not encoded here:
-- named inputs. The 2022 wage agreement's §5.6 names this agreement's
-- shekel supplement ("the shekel supplement of 19.3.2017"); its §§7 and 12
-- raise the counselling and pedagogical coordinator's rates this one sets.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `base-agreement-39`
IMPORT `base-agreement-131`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`
IMPORT `2016-09-30_ofek-hadash_september-2016-agreement`

-- What the parties must, may or may not do under this agreement.
DECLARE `March 2017 action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the differences of (ג1)`
    `pay the payments of (ג2)`
    `pay the protection supplement's differences`
    `pay the shekel supplement as (י) sets`
    `support the legislation of the new §10(א)`
    `demand a further increase of the determining salary, a supplement or a benefit for the March 2017 costs`

§ `תיקון הסכם ספטמבר 2016 — 19.3.2017`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 15-06-2017 as no. 120/2017; no rule of the agreement.

-- The day of signing (כא אדר תשע"ז).
@ref akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4
`the March 2017 agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 3 2017

-- The parties: the State, by the Treasury's wages commissioner and the
-- Ministry of Education's director-general, and the teachers' union, by
-- its secretary-general.
@ref akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9
`the March 2017 agreement's parties` MEANS LIST `the State`, `the teachers' union`

-- akn:preamble/p7 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 "On the other side"; no rule.

-- The recitals: the September 2016 agreement (imported); after long
-- negotiation, more time to agree on the allocation of its §7(ב)–(ד),
-- otherwise than its default (§7(ה)); a different allocation and a further
-- one, against a longer exhaustion of claims and industrial peace.
@ref akn:preamble/p11
`the agreement this one amends was signed on` MEANS `the September 2016 agreement was signed on`

@ref akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13
`the March 2017 agreement allocates §7(ב)–(ד)'s cost otherwise than §7(ה)` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the parties anchor what they agreed in a collective agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 הוראות כלליות`

-- (א): the preamble is an inseparable part of the agreement.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN p IS A `part of the agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an inseparable part of the March 2017 agreement` p IF
    TRUE

-- (ב)–(ג): the masculine includes the feminine, the singular the plural,
-- and the reverse, unless said otherwise expressly: the base agreement's §2.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_c
GIVEN `written in` IS A `form of a word`, `read in` IS A `form of a word`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the March 2017 agreement reads in another form` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    `a word written in one form reads in another` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited`

-- (ד): the headings are for convenience; nothing is learnt from them.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d
GIVEN `the reading without the headings` IS A STRING, `the reading the headings suggest` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the reading the March 2017 agreement takes` `the reading without the headings` `the reading the headings suggest` IS
    `the reading without the headings`

§§ `2 תיקון הסכם ספטמבר 2016`

-- (א): in §3 of the September 2016 agreement, 30.6.2019 for 30.6.2018.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
`the September 2016 agreement runs until, as amended` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2019

#ASSERT `the September 2016 agreement runs until` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2018

-- (ב): after §4(ג) of the September 2016 agreement come (ג1) and (ג2).
-- (ג1): notwithstanding §4(א)–(ב), a teaching employee placed after the
-- conversion in grade 6, 6.5, 7, 7.5, 8 or 8.5 and not promoted since ("a
-- first promotion") who (1) acquired the development hours for grade 7, 8
-- or 9 by the Ministry's letter of 25.12.2008 and (2) met the stay of
-- §38(ו), as the 2015 decision worded it, by 30.9.2016, is promoted to
-- grade 7, 8 or 9 from the day he met them all ("יום הזכאות"). (ג2): one in
-- grade 6–8.5 not promoted since 1.9.2013, not entitled by (ג) or (ג1), who
-- acquired the hours and met the stay by 31.12.2016, is promoted from
-- 1.4.2017. The quotation of the insertion closes after (ג1); (ג2), numbered
-- and worded as a clause of §4 ("(ג) או (ג1) לעיל"), is read as part of it
-- (convention instruments.quotation-extent).
@desc A teaching employee in grade 6–8.5, as far as (ג1) and (ג2) ask.
DECLARE `teacher for the 2017 promotions` HAS
    `grade now`                                   IS A NUMBER
    `placed in it by the conversion and not promoted since` IS A BOOLEAN
    `promoted since 1.9.2013`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `entitled by §4(ג)`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the day the development hours were acquired` IS A DATE @desc for grade 7, 8 or 9, by the Ministry's letter of 25.12.2008 (not in the corpus)
    `the day the stay of §38(ו) as the 2015 decision worded it was met` IS A DATE @desc the follow-up committee's decision of 19.2.2015 sets the periods; an input here

@ref akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN t IS A `teacher for the 2017 promotions`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grade (ג1) or (ג2) promotes to` t IS
    FLOOR (t's `grade now`) PLUS 1

GIVEN t IS A `teacher for the 2017 promotions`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in grade 6 to 8.5` t IF
    elem (t's `grade now`) (LIST 6, 6.5, 7, 7.5, 8, 8.5)

@ref akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN t IS A `teacher for the 2017 promotions`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `promoted under (ג1) from` t IS
    IF      `in grade 6 to 8.5` t
        AND t's `placed in it by the conversion and not promoted since`
        AND (t's `the day the stay of §38(ו) as the 2015 decision worded it was met` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2016))
    THEN JUST (DATE_FROM_SERIAL (max (DATE_SERIAL (t's `the day the development hours were acquired`)) (DATE_SERIAL (t's `the day the stay of §38(ו) as the 2015 decision worded it was met`))))
    ELSE NOTHING

@ref akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN t IS A `teacher for the 2017 promotions`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `promoted under (ג2) from` t IS
    IF      `in grade 6 to 8.5` t
        AND NOT t's `promoted since 1.9.2013`
        AND NOT t's `entitled by §4(ג)`
        AND `promoted under (ג1) from` t EQUALS NOTHING
        AND (t's `the day the development hours were acquired` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2016))
        AND (t's `the day the stay of §38(ו) as the 2015 decision worded it was met` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2016))
    THEN JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2017)
    ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN g IS A NUMBER, converted IS A BOOLEAN, hours IS A DATE, stay IS A DATE
GIVETH A `teacher for the 2017 promotions`
DECIDE `a 2017 promotion teacher` g converted hours stay IS
    `teacher for the 2017 promotions` WITH
        `grade now`                                   IS g
        `placed in it by the conversion and not promoted since` IS converted
        `promoted since 1.9.2013`                     IS FALSE
        `entitled by §4(ג)`                            IS FALSE
        `the day the development hours were acquired` IS hours
        `the day the stay of §38(ו) as the 2015 decision worded it was met` IS stay

-- Converted to 6.5, the stay met on 1.6.2016 and the hours on 1.2.2017: to
-- grade 7 from 1.2.2017. Not converted, both met in 2016: (ג2), 1.4.2017.
#ASSERT `promoted under (ג1) from` (`a 2017 promotion teacher` 6.5 TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2017) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2016)) EQUALS JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2017)
#ASSERT `the grade (ג1) or (ג2) promotes to` (`a 2017 promotion teacher` 6.5 TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2017) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2016)) EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `promoted under (ג2) from` (`a 2017 promotion teacher` 8 FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2016) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2016)) EQUALS JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2017)
#ASSERT `promoted under (ג2) from` (`a 2017 promotion teacher` 6.5 TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2017) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2016)) EQUALS NOTHING

-- (ג): after §4(ח) come (ט) and (י): the differences of (ג1), and the
-- payments of (ג2), are paid in the salary for April 2017 to those found by
-- 31.3.2017 to meet the conditions; to those who met them by then but whose
-- data were not yet updated, and to those who meet them from 1.4.2017, in
-- the salary for the month after the entitlement is found, at the latest
-- the next.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c
GIVEN `found to meet them by 31.3.2017` IS A BOOLEAN, `the salary month the entitlement is found in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last salary month for the 2017 promotions' payments` `found to meet them by 31.3.2017` `the salary month the entitlement is found in` IS
    IF `found to meet them by 31.3.2017`
    THEN `September 2016 salary month` 2017 4
    ELSE `the salary month the entitlement is found in` PLUS 2

#ASSERT `the last salary month for the 2017 promotions' payments` TRUE 0 EQUALS `September 2016 salary month` 2017 4
#ASSERT `the last salary month for the 2017 promotions' payments` FALSE (`September 2016 salary month` 2017 6) EQUALS `September 2016 salary month` 2017 8

@ref akn:art_2__para_c
`paying the 2017 promotions` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State` MUST `pay the differences of (ג1)`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the State` MUST `pay the payments of (ג2)`)

-- (ד) in §5(ב) of the September 2016 agreement: (1) X and Y lose the
-- deduction of the seniority rise on the determining date (the tables are
-- still those in force on 31.8.2016 for X); (2) (5) is replaced: an
-- existing teacher promoted by a grade or half a grade after 1.9.2016 loses
-- the supplement for good; (3) (6) and (7) are void; (4) (8)–(10) speak of Z
-- for C; (5) the differences are paid in the salary for March 2017, at the
-- latest April's.
@ref akn:art_2__para_d akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_1
GIVEN t IS A `teacher at the September 2016 tables`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Z under §5(ב)(2) as amended in 2017` t IS
    IF `an existing teacher under §5(ב)` t
    THEN (t's `old table salary` PLUS t's `old allowances`) MINUS (t's `new table salary` PLUS t's `new allowances`)
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_3
GIVEN t IS A `teacher at the September 2016 tables`, `promoted after 1.9.2016 on` IS A MAYBE DATE, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the protection supplement under §5(ב) as amended in 2017 on` t `promoted after 1.9.2016 on` d IS
    CONSIDER `promoted after 1.9.2016 on`
    WHEN JUST p THEN (IF d `is on or after` p THEN 0 ELSE `Z under §5(ב)(2) as amended in 2017` t)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `Z under §5(ב)(2) as amended in 2017` t

@ref akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_4
GIVEN p IS A `September 2016 salary purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the protection supplement Z counts for` p IF
    `the protection supplement C counts for` p

@ref akn:art_2__para_d__subpara_5
GIVEN `paid with the salary for` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the protection supplement's differences are paid in time` `paid with the salary for` IF
    `paid with the salary for` AT MOST `September 2016 salary month` 2017 4

-- The amendment adds the seniority rise back: for the grade-8 teacher of
-- the September 2016 file, 330 for 327, and no shrinking but at a promotion.
#ASSERT `Z under §5(ב)(2) as amended in 2017` `an existing grade-8 teacher` EQUALS 330
#ASSERT `the protection supplement under §5(ב) as amended in 2017 on` `an existing grade-8 teacher` NOTHING (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2018) EQUALS 330
#ASSERT `the protection supplement under §5(ב) as amended in 2017 on` `an existing grade-8 teacher` (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017)) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2018) EQUALS 0

-- (ה): §6(ב) of the September 2016 agreement is replaced. For a full
-- position: (1) 1.9.2016–28.2.2017, 108.18 for all; (2) 1.3.2017–31.5.2019,
-- by grade on the Ofek Hadash combined tables for ACADEMIC teachers — grade
-- 1 340.17, 1.5 319.78, 2 299.39, 2.5 246.52 — and 193.64 for any other;
-- (3) 1.6.2019–31.8.2019, the same grades 648.48, 628.09, 607.70, 554.83,
-- any other 501.96; (4) 1.9.2019–31.8.2020, by grade on the tables of
-- academic OR non-academic teachers — 1 730.83, 1.5 703.73, 2 676.64, 2.5
-- 643.85, 3 611.07, 3.5 593.51, 4 575.96, 4.5 538.96 — any other 501.96
-- (unchanged from (3)(ה)); (5) from 1.9.2020, 1 1,074.37, 1.5 1,011.48, 2
-- 948.59, 2.5 872.47, 3 796.36, 3.5 755.61, 4 714.86, 4.5 628.96, any other
-- 543.33.
-- F-ofek-hadash-march-2017-a: (4)(ד) prints 643.85 and spells "ארבע מאות
-- ארבעים ושלושה ש"ח ושמונים וחמש אגורות", 443.85. The reading adopted
-- (convention reading.misprint): the figure, which keeps the grades in the
-- order every other step keeps them; the spelled words are the slip.
@desc A row of the replaced §6(ב): the amount from a day for a grade on the Ofek Hadash tables.
DECLARE `2017 shekel supplement row` HAS
    `row from`             IS A DATE
    `row grade`            IS A NUMBER @desc 0 for the row of every other teaching employee
    `academic tables only` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the grade on the tables of academic teachers only ((2)–(3)), or of academic or non-academic teachers ((4)–(5))
    `row amount`           IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_2__para_e
`the 2017 shekel supplement rows` MEANS
    LIST `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2016) 0 FALSE 108.18,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) 1 TRUE 340.17,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) 1.5 TRUE 319.78,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) 2 TRUE 299.39,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) 2.5 TRUE 246.52,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) 0 FALSE 193.64,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2019) 1 TRUE 648.48,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2019) 1.5 TRUE 628.09,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2019) 2 TRUE 607.70,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2019) 2.5 TRUE 554.83,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2019) 0 FALSE 501.96,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 1 FALSE 730.83,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 1.5 FALSE 703.73,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 2 FALSE 676.64,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 2.5 FALSE 643.85,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 3 FALSE 611.07,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 3.5 FALSE 593.51,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 4 FALSE 575.96,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 4.5 FALSE 538.96,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) 0 FALSE 501.96,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 1 FALSE 1074.37,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 1.5 FALSE 1011.48,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 2 FALSE 948.59,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 2.5 FALSE 872.47,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 3 FALSE 796.36,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 3.5 FALSE 755.61,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 4 FALSE 714.86,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 4.5 FALSE 628.96,
         `2017 shekel supplement row` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) 0 FALSE 543.33

-- The days the rows begin, in order.
`the days the replaced §6(ב) steps on` MEANS
    LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2016, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2019, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020

@desc A teaching employee's placement, as far as the replaced §6(ב) asks.
DECLARE `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement` HAS
    `on the Ofek Hadash combined tables` IS A BOOLEAN
    `on the academic teachers' tables`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `grade on the tables`                IS A NUMBER

-- Whether a row is the placement's: its grade, on the tables it names.
GIVEN r IS A `2017 shekel supplement row`, p IS A `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade row names the placement` r p IF
        NOT r's `row grade` EQUALS 0
    AND p's `on the Ofek Hadash combined tables`
    AND p's `grade on the tables` EQUALS r's `row grade`
    AND ((NOT r's `academic tables only`) OR p's `on the academic teachers' tables`)

-- The amount for a full position on a step's day: the row naming the
-- placement, else the row of every other employee.
GIVEN p IS A `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement`, `step day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2017 amount on the step` p `step day` IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row from` EQUALS `step day` AND `a grade row names the placement` r p) `the 2017 shekel supplement rows`
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN r's `row amount`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN
        foldl (GIVEN acc, r YIELD IF r's `row from` EQUALS `step day` AND r's `row grade` EQUALS 0 THEN r's `row amount` ELSE acc) 0 `the 2017 shekel supplement rows`

-- The placement's periods, in the September 2016 agreement's shape, so its
-- linkage (§6(ד)) and its share of a position (§6(ג)) run on them unchanged.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e
GIVEN p IS A `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement`
GIVETH A LIST OF `shekel supplement period`
DECIDE `the 2017 shekel supplement periods for` p IS
    map (GIVEN day YIELD `shekel supplement period` day (`the 2017 amount on the step` p day)) `the days the replaced §6(ב) steps on`

GIVEN onOfek IS A BOOLEAN, academic IS A BOOLEAN, g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement`
DECIDE `a 2017 placement` onOfek academic g IS
    `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement` WITH
        `on the Ofek Hadash combined tables` IS onOfek
        `on the academic teachers' tables`   IS academic
        `grade on the tables`                IS g

#ASSERT `the full-position amount in force` (`the 2017 shekel supplement periods for` (`a 2017 placement` TRUE TRUE 1)) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) EQUALS 340.17
-- A non-academic teacher in grade 1 has the other employees' amount until
-- 31.8.2019, and grade 1's from 1.9.2019.
#ASSERT `the full-position amount in force` (`the 2017 shekel supplement periods for` (`a 2017 placement` TRUE FALSE 1)) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) EQUALS 193.64
#ASSERT `the full-position amount in force` (`the 2017 shekel supplement periods for` (`a 2017 placement` TRUE FALSE 1)) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) EQUALS 730.83
#ASSERT `the full-position amount in force` (`the 2017 shekel supplement periods for` (`a 2017 placement` FALSE FALSE 0)) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) EQUALS 543.33
#ASSERT `the shekel supplement for a teaching employee` (`the 2017 shekel supplement periods for` (`a 2017 placement` TRUE TRUE 2)) `hypothetical December indices` 0.5 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) EQUALS 149.695
-- (1) is the September 2016 agreement's first step, (5)(ט) its last.
#ASSERT `the 2017 amount on the step` (`a 2017 placement` FALSE FALSE 0) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2016) EQUALS `the full-position amount in force` `the September 2016 shekel supplement periods` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2016)
#ASSERT `the 2017 amount on the step` (`a 2017 placement` FALSE FALSE 0) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) EQUALS `the full-position amount in force` `the September 2016 shekel supplement periods` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2019)
-- (4)(ט) is (3)(ה), "unchanged from 1.6.2019".
#ASSERT `the 2017 amount on the step` (`a 2017 placement` FALSE FALSE 0) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) EQUALS `the 2017 amount on the step` (`a 2017 placement` FALSE FALSE 0) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2019)

-- On every step the amount falls as the grade rises, and the other
-- employees' row is the lowest — with 643.85 at grade 2.5 on 1.9.2019; the
-- spelled 443.85 would put grade 2.5 below every grade above it.
GIVEN `step day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts of a step, by grade then the others'` `step day` IS
    append (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row amount`) (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row from` EQUALS `step day` AND NOT r's `row grade` EQUALS 0) `the 2017 shekel supplement rows`))
           (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row amount`) (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row from` EQUALS `step day` AND r's `row grade` EQUALS 0) `the 2017 shekel supplement rows`))

GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `falls all the way` xs IF
    and (zipWith (GIVEN a, b YIELD a GREATER THAN b) xs (drop 1 xs))

#ASSERT all (GIVEN day YIELD `falls all the way` (`the amounts of a step, by grade then the others'` day)) `the days the replaced §6(ב) steps on`

`the spelled amount of (4)(ד)` MEANS 443.85
`the printed amount of (4)(ד)` MEANS 643.85

`(4)(ד) prints one amount and spells another` MEANS
        NOT (`the spelled amount of (4)(ד)` EQUALS `the printed amount of (4)(ד)`)
    AND `the 2017 amount on the step` (`a 2017 placement` TRUE TRUE 2.5) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) EQUALS `the printed amount of (4)(ד)`
    AND `the spelled amount of (4)(ד)` LESS THAN `the 2017 amount on the step` (`a 2017 placement` TRUE TRUE 4.5) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019)
#ASSERT `(4)(ד) prints one amount and spells another`

-- (ו): from 1.3.2017 §6(י) is replaced. (1) the payments of (ב)(2)(ה) from
-- the salary for March 2017, at the latest April's, with the differences
-- from 1.3.2017; (2) those of (ב)(2)(א)–(ד) from the salary for April 2017,
-- at the latest May's, with the differences from 1.3.2017; (3) meanwhile,
-- when (1) is paid, the teachers of (א)–(ד) have their supplement raised to
-- 193.64, counted in (2)'s differences; (4) those of (ב)(3)–(5) in the
-- salary for the first month of entitlement, at the latest the next, with
-- its differences; (5) what was paid for (ב)(1) under (י) as it stood on
-- 28.2.2017 is not paid twice.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement`, `step day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last salary month the 2017 supplement step is paid in` p `step day` IS
    IF `step day` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017
    THEN (IF any (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row from` EQUALS `step day` AND `a grade row names the placement` r p) `the 2017 shekel supplement rows`
          THEN `September 2016 salary month` 2017 5
          ELSE `September 2016 salary month` 2017 4)
    ELSE `September 2016 salary month` (DATE_YEAR `step day`) (DATE_MONTH `step day`) PLUS 1

-- (ו)(3): the interim amount paid to a teacher of (ב)(2)(א)–(ד) until (2)
-- is paid: the other employees' 193.64.
GIVEN p IS A `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the interim 2017 amount` p IS
    min (`the 2017 amount on the step` p (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017)) 193.64

@ref akn:art_2__para_f
`paying the 2017 shekel supplement` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `pay the shekel supplement as (י) sets`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "§6(י) as replaced: each step by its last salary month, (ב)(1) never twice"

#ASSERT `the last salary month the 2017 supplement step is paid in` (`a 2017 placement` TRUE TRUE 1) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) EQUALS `September 2016 salary month` 2017 5
#ASSERT `the last salary month the 2017 supplement step is paid in` (`a 2017 placement` FALSE FALSE 0) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017) EQUALS `September 2016 salary month` 2017 4
#ASSERT `the last salary month the 2017 supplement step is paid in` (`a 2017 placement` FALSE FALSE 0) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020) EQUALS `September 2016 salary month` 2020 10
#ASSERT `the interim 2017 amount` (`a 2017 placement` TRUE TRUE 1) EQUALS 193.64

-- (ז): §7 of the September 2016 agreement is void. (ח): in its §9(ב) the
-- words "save for §7(א)–(ד) of this agreement" are struck out: the 2016
-- agreement's §6 serves nothing any more.
@ref akn:art_2__para_g
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the total update of the tables under §7(ה) as amended in 2017` d IS
    0

#ASSERT `the total update of the tables under §7(ה) on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2019) EQUALS 1.26%
#ASSERT `the total update of the tables under §7(ה) as amended in 2017` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2019) EQUALS 0

@ref akn:art_2__para_h
`the 2016 salary base still serves §7 of the September 2016 agreement, as amended in 2017` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT `the 2016 salary base still serves §7 of the September 2016 agreement`

-- (ט): §10 of the September 2016 agreement is replaced. (א) the Treasury
-- announces it intends to circulate a bill amending the Pensions Law: (1)
-- for one who retired between 1.1.2013 and 31.8.2020, graded on the
-- teaching employees' scale ("פורש זכאי"); (2) the determining salary grows
-- by Y = X·A: X the coefficient for the month of retirement in annex ה' —
-- which (י) makes this agreement's annex א' (below) — and A the full shekel
-- supplement under this agreement for an employee of the retiree's grade
-- on the eve of retirement; (3) gradually, by the annex's dates. (ב) the
-- union accepts the principles and supports the legislation (1); once it is
-- passed, no demand for the determining salary, a supplement or a benefit
-- for these costs or for the period to 30.6.2019 (2). (ג) the jubilee grant's
-- base grows by Y, gradually, its day unchanged.
-- F-ofek-hadash-march-2017-b: the annex sets coefficients from 1.1.2013,
-- while no shekel supplement was paid before 1.9.2016, and A is "the full
-- amount of the shekel supplement paid under this agreement". The reading
-- adopted (convention reading.every-word): A is the full amount the steps
-- reach for the retiree's grade (from 1.9.2020), so every column of the
-- annex multiplies an amount.
@ref akn:art_2__para_i
GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE, `graded on the teaching employees' scale on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an eligible retiree under §10 as replaced in 2017` `retired on` `graded on the teaching employees' scale on the eve` IF
        `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)
    AND `retired on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2020)
    AND `graded on the teaching employees' scale on the eve`

GIVEN p IS A `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A, the full shekel supplement for the retiree's grade` p IS
    `the 2017 amount on the step` p (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020)

-- The other reading: A is the amount in force in the column's period.
GIVEN p IS A `placement for the 2017 shekel supplement`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A in force on the day` p d IS
    `the full-position amount in force` (`the 2017 shekel supplement periods for` p) d

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Y, the increase of the determining salary under §10 as replaced in 2017` x a IS
    x TIMES a

@ref akn:art_2__para_i
`the union supports the 2017 pensions amendment` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MUST  `support the legislation of the new §10(א)`

@ref akn:art_2__para_i
GIVEN `the amendment is passed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `March 2017 action`
DECIDE `no further pension demand after the 2017 amendment` `the amendment is passed` IS
    IF `the amendment is passed`
    THEN PARTY `the teachers' union`
         SHANT `demand a further increase of the determining salary, a supplement or a benefit for the March 2017 costs`
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:art_2__para_i
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant base's increase under §10 as replaced in 2017` y IS
    y

-- (י): this agreement's annex א' stands in place of the September 2016
-- agreement's annex ה'. (יא): the union explains its notice of §10(ב) by the
-- amendment's aim, to raise the determining salary of a retiree or his
-- survivor.
@ref akn:art_2__para_j akn:art_2__para_ja
`annex א' of the March 2017 agreement replaces annex ה' of the September 2016 agreement` MEANS TRUE

-- (יב): in §11 of the September 2016 agreement, (1) 30.6.2019 for 30.6.2018
-- in (א); (2) (ב)(1), the guides' exception, is struck out (the guides'
-- agreement of 9.11.2016 exhausted it).
@ref akn:art_2__para_jb akn:art_2__para_jb__subpara_1
`the September 2016 agreement exhausts the claims to, as amended` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2019

#ASSERT `the September 2016 agreement exhausts the claims to, as amended` EQUALS `the September 2016 agreement runs until, as amended`

@ref akn:art_2__para_jb__subpara_2
GIVEN m IS A `matter left open by §11 of the September 2016 agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§11 of the September 2016 agreement leaves open, as amended` m IF
    `§11 of the September 2016 agreement leaves open` m
    AND NOT m EQUALS `the reform for teaching employees in guidance roles`

#ASSERT `§11 of the September 2016 agreement leaves open` `the reform for teaching employees in guidance roles`
#ASSERT NOT `§11 of the September 2016 agreement leaves open, as amended` `the reform for teaching employees in guidance roles`

§§ `3 גמולי תפקיד חדשים`

-- (א): from 1.9.2017, §39ב is added to the base agreement: a teacher who is
-- (א) coordinator of inclusion and special populations, (ב) evaluator of
-- learning functions (מת"ל) in a junior high school, or (ג) trips
-- coordinator has a role allowance of 6% of the combined salary; (ד) a
-- mentor teacher or a mentor kindergarten teacher 2.4% for each intern; (ה)
-- by the rules of computing and paying the subject coordinator's allowance
-- (§39, imported); (ו) §39(ב) (two allowances, a third with the district
-- manager's approval; imported) and §39(ב1) (paid while the role is held;
-- the completion agreement's, imported) apply. (ג): from 1.9.2019 §39ג: the
-- pedagogical coordinator (curriculum planning), 6%, by the same rules.
-- (ב), (ד): a teacher off the reform who fills one of these roles in an
-- institution of §3 of the base agreement only has the same rate, by the
-- rules of a subject coordinator off the reform.
DECLARE `new role of 2017` IS ONE OF
    `coordinator of inclusion and special populations`
    `evaluator of learning functions in a junior high school`
    `trips coordinator`
    `mentor teacher or mentor kindergarten teacher` HAS `interns mentored` IS A NUMBER
    `pedagogical coordinator (curriculum planning)`

@ref akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_b akn:art_3__para_c akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN r IS A `new role of 2017`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate of a new role allowance` r d IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `pedagogical coordinator (curriculum planning)` THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) THEN 6% ELSE 0
    WHEN `mentor teacher or mentor kindergarten teacher` n THEN
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) THEN 2.4% TIMES n ELSE 0
    OTHERWISE
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) THEN 6% ELSE 0

-- Paid as the subject coordinator's allowance is: the base agreement's §39
-- rule for a role at the rate, on the case's combined salary, while the
-- role is held (§39(ב1)).
GIVEN r IS A `new role of 2017`, c IS AN `allowance case`, `holds the role` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a new role allowance` r c `holds the role` d IS
    IF `paid the role's allowance` `holds the role`
    THEN `the rate of a new role allowance` r d TIMES c's `full-position combined salary`
         TIMES (IF c's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1/3 THEN 1 ELSE 0)
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the rate of a new role allowance` `trips coordinator` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) EQUALS 6%
#ASSERT `the rate of a new role allowance` (`mentor teacher or mentor kindergarten teacher` 3) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) EQUALS 7.2%
-- F-ofek-hadash-march-2017-c: (ד) pays each mentor "for each intern" and no
-- sentence says an intern counts for one mentor only (takanon §3.21 speaks of
-- "the mentor" without limiting it), so two mentors appointed to one intern
-- are each paid for that intern. The rule counts each mentor's interns and
-- adds no limit the text does not state.
#ASSERT `the rate of a new role allowance` (`mentor teacher or mentor kindergarten teacher` 1) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) PLUS `the rate of a new role allowance` (`mentor teacher or mentor kindergarten teacher` 1) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) EQUALS 4.8%
#ASSERT `the rate of a new role allowance` `pedagogical coordinator (curriculum planning)` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2018) EQUALS 0

-- The agreement's claims for the root (MMS-521): the pedagogical
-- coordinator's rate from 1.9.2019, when (ג) adds the role, and a mentor's
-- for the interns mentored from 1.9.2017; before then it says nothing of
-- either. It speaks for any teaching employee on Ofek Hadash terms.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to the agreement of 19.3.2017` c IS
    IF `the salary month is at least` c 2019 9
    THEN JUST (`the rate of a new role allowance` `pedagogical coordinator (curriculum planning)` (c's `the salary month`))
    ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor's rate according to the agreement of 19.3.2017` c IS
    IF `the salary month is at least` c 2017 9
    THEN JUST (`the rate of a new role allowance` (`mentor teacher or mentor kindergarten teacher` (c's `the interns the teacher mentors`)) (c's `the salary month`))
    ELSE NOTHING

-- How the agreement describes itself as an instrument (MMS-521), for the root.
`the agreement of 19.3.2017` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "2017-03-19_ofek-hadash_march-2017-amendment"
        `title`         IS "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 19.3.2017, סעיף 3"
        `kind`          IS `a collective agreement`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 3 2017
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE
#ASSERT `a new role allowance` `trips coordinator` `a full-time teacher on 8,000` TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) EQUALS 480
#ASSERT `a new role allowance` `trips coordinator` `a full-time teacher on 8,000` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) EQUALS 0
-- The same as a primary subject coordinator's allowance, as (ה) says.
#ASSERT `a new role allowance` `trips coordinator` `a full-time teacher on 8,000` TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) EQUALS `the role allowance` (`subject coordinator` `a primary school`) `a full-time teacher on 8,000`
-- (ו): §39(ב)'s cap counts them: three role allowances need the approval.
#ASSERT `role allowances payable at most` FALSE EQUALS 2

DECLARE `employment of a new role's holder` IS ONE OF
    `on the reform's terms in a base-agreement institution`
    `off the reform in a base-agreement institution`
    `elsewhere`

@ref akn:art_3__para_b akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN e IS AN `employment of a new role's holder`, r IS A `new role of 2017`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rate of a new role allowance by the holder's terms` e r d IS
    IF e EQUALS `elsewhere` THEN 0 ELSE `the rate of a new role allowance` r d

#ASSERT `the rate of a new role allowance by the holder's terms` `off the reform in a base-agreement institution` `coordinator of inclusion and special populations` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2017) EQUALS 6%

§§ `4 גמול ייעוץ`

-- (א): from 1.9.2019, in §131 of the base agreement (as the completion
-- agreement worded it): (1) 8% for 6%, (2) 12% for 9% — the maxima of a
-- counsellor with a temporary and a permanent licence. The rest of §131 (the
-- counselling hours, imported) is unchanged.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN l IS A `counselling licence`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the maximum counselling rate as amended in 2017` l d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019)
    THEN (IF l EQUALS `a permanent licence` THEN 12% ELSE 8%)
    ELSE `the maximum counselling rate` l

GIVEN l IS A `counselling licence`, h IS A `counsellor's hours`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the counselling rate as amended in 2017` l h d IS
    IF h's Y AT LEAST `counselling hours an allowance asks at least`
    THEN `the maximum counselling rate as amended in 2017` l d TIMES `the number of counselling hours` h DIVIDED BY 16
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the maximum counselling rate as amended in 2017` `a permanent licence` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2019) EQUALS 9%
#ASSERT `the maximum counselling rate as amended in 2017` `a permanent licence` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) EQUALS 12%
#ASSERT `the maximum counselling rate as amended in 2017` `a temporary licence` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) EQUALS 8%
-- §131's worked example's counsellor, from 1.9.2019: 12% × 14.1666…/16.
#ASSERT `the counselling rate as amended in 2017` `a permanent licence` `the example's counsellor` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2019) EQUALS `the counselling rate` `a permanent licence` `the example's counsellor` TIMES 12 DIVIDED BY 9

§§ `5–6 הסכמים קודמים; מיצוי תביעות ושקט תעשייתי`

-- §5: the terms of earlier agreements, arrangements and written
-- undertakings stand in the agreement's period, unless expressly or
-- impliedly amended or cancelled by it.
@ref akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN `amended or cancelled by this agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier term stands under the March 2017 agreement` `amended or cancelled by this agreement` IF
    NOT `amended or cancelled by this agreement`

-- §6: the September 2016 agreement's cancellation of the labour dispute, its
-- exhaustion of claims and its industrial peace, as amended here, reach
-- this agreement too (imported).
@ref akn:art_6/p1
`industrial peace under the March 2017 agreement` MEANS `industrial peace under the September 2016 agreement`

#ASSERT NOT `a union dispute notice stands under the September 2016 agreement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 6 12 2015)

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties' signature headings; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The Treasury's file number; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' — המקדם X`

-- The annex (in place of annex ה' of the September 2016 agreement): for
-- each last month as an active employee, from January 2013 to August 2020,
-- the coefficient X in each of four periods — 1.1.2013–31.8.2016,
-- 1.9.2016–28.2.2017, 1.3.2017–31.5.2019, and from 1.6.2019. A blank cell
-- (a period that ended before that month) is NOTHING.
@desc A row of the coefficient table: the last month as an active employee and the coefficient in each period.
DECLARE `pensioners' coefficient row` HAS
    `last active year`  IS A NUMBER
    `last active month` IS A NUMBER
    `X to 31.8.2016`    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `X to 28.2.2017`    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `X to 31.5.2019`    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `X from 1.6.2019`   IS A MAYBE NUMBER

